    "chunk_text": "Seylan Bank enables seamless integration with eChannelling through Open API Banking platform\n\nFrom left: LankaPay Manager - Business Development Kasun Wickramasinghe, Deputy Chief Executive Officer Dinuka Perera, and Chief Executive Officer Channa de Silva gathered alongside Seylan Bank AGM Digital Banking Chami Senewiratne, Head of Business Development & Revenue, eChannelling Mohan Ajitkumar, Finance Manager, eChannelling Sandun Randeni, and Seylan Bank Manager \u2013 Digital Commerce Vidula Rajapakshe to integrate eChanelling with Seylan Bank\u2019s open API Banking platform\n\nSeylan Bank PLC has partnered with eChannelling Ltd., to integrate with the Bank\u2019s Open Application Programming Interface Banking platform, a move that marks another milestone in Seylan\u2019s digital banking journey.\n\nThrough this integration, eChannelling will now execute real-time, secure, and automated payments via Bank Accounts in collaboration with LankaPay\u2019s JustPay services. It also facilitates instantaneous reconciliation which is paramount in this operation. The collaboration enhances operational efficiency, minimises manual intervention, and ensures faster transaction settlements, ultimately supporting eChannelling\u2019s digital-first service delivery model.\n\nSeylan Bank\u2019s Open API Banking platform enables Corporate and SME clients to connect their Enterprise Resource Planning or internal business systems with the Bank\u2019s infrastructure, offering seamless, secure, and automated transactional financial services. This integration simplifies high-volume transaction management and drives efficiency across multiple business operations.\n\n\u201cThis partnership with eChannelling demonstrates how Seylan Bank\u2019s Open API Banking platform is transforming the way businesses manage payments,\u201d said Seylan Bank AGM Digital Banking Chami Senewiratne. \u201cOur goal is to empower Sri Lankan enterprises with technology-driven financial solutions that promote speed, security, and automation.\u201d"
