    "chunk_text": "Under the guise of conservation \u2013 read corporate strategies to boost business profitability in the name of sustainability \u2013 there is a risk that depopulation policies will disenfranchise already affected communities. Especially in fragile central highlands and other ecologically vulnerable areas.\n\nA Government-led process \u2013 no matter how well-intentioned (while at the same time, perhaps deceptive and disingenuous) \u2013 cannot guarantee social justice if the forcibly removed populations bear the brunt of a plan they had no part in shaping."
